flowchart TD
  User[Security Engineer]
  UI[QuantumShield Web UI\nReact + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind]
  API[Scan Orchestration API\nFastAPI on Render]
  Input[Repository / Input Layer\nSource, manifests, certs, configs, bytecode]
  Discover[Discovery & File Enumeration\nSafe traversal, type classification, archive guards]
  Scanners[Language & Artifact Scanners\nPython AST, Java/JS/C static, manifests, X.509, configs, JVM bytecode]
  Normalize[Evidence Normalization\nProvenance, rule IDs, line ranges, confidence]
  Dedup[Cross-Scanner Deduplication\nNormPath, Line, Algorithm, Usage]
  Classify[Cryptographic Classification\nShor-broken, Grover-weakened, legacy-broken, quantum-safe]
  Threat[Threat Surface Tagging\nHNDL confidentiality, TNFL authenticity]
  Mosca[Mosca Engine\nX + Y > Z exposure timeline]
  Risk[Risk Intelligence Engine\n0.35 Q + 0.25 B + 0.15 E + 0.15 S + 0.10 (1-A)]
  Recommend[Migration Recommendation Engine\nFIPS 203 / 204 / 205 / SP 800-208]
  Track[Migration Tracking\nClassical -> Hybrid -> PQC]
  CBOM[CBOM Generator\nCycloneDX 1.6 schema-validated]
  Reports[Report Generator\nSARIF, CSV, HTML, PDF, Markdown]
  Outputs[Deliverables\ncbom.json, inventory.csv, findings.sarif, report.html, report.pdf, summary.md]

  Terminal[Temporary Scan Workspace\nQuarantined extracted content, deleted after run]
  Security[Security Boundaries\nPath traversal protection, Zip Slip guards,\narchive bomb guards, defusedxml, no shell=True]
  Secrets[No Private-Key Persistence\nMetadata only, never secret material]

  User --> UI
  UI --> API
  API --> Input
  Input --> Discover
  Discover --> Scanners
  Scanners --> Normalize
  Normalize --> Dedup
  Dedup --> Classify
  Classify --> Threat
  Threat --> Mosca
  Mosca --> Risk
  Risk --> Recommend
  Recommend --> Track
  Track --> CBOM
  CBOM --> Reports
  Reports --> Outputs

  Discover -. uses .-> Terminal
  Scanners -. protected by .-> Security
  Scanners -. respects .-> Secrets
  UI -. verified against .-> API

  Cloud[Vercel Frontend CDN]
  Backend[Render FastAPI Backend]
  Local[Local launcher: python run.py]

  UI -. deployed on .-> Cloud
  API -. deployed on .-> Backend
  API -. also runs .-> Local
